    "termsOfUse": "The PRIMS data are available for scientific research subject to specific conditions.<br>\nResearchers are required to complete an application form in the guestbook of this dataset. All requests are evaluated based on the following criteria: <br>\n1. Relevance: Does the research question align with the objectives of PRIMS?<br>\n2. Overlap: Does the proposed study interfere with ongoing research? <br>\n3. Feasibility: Can the research question be answered using PRIMS?<br>\nIn addition, approved users must sign a Data Transfer Agreement.<br>",
